## DMX Addressing Plan (assumes 108 channels/fixture)

Universe 1 (Serial1)
- A1 start: 1
- A2 start: 1 + 108 = 109
- A3 start: 217

Universe 2 (Serial2)
- A4 start: 1
- A5 start: 109

Set these via fixture menu/DIP and select the same 108‑ch personality on all lamps.

