## Risks and Mitigations

- Unknown fixture channel maps
  - Mitigation: quick mapping pass in Phase 1; capture per‑fixture DMX map in a fixtures.md.
- Channel overlap by wrong start addresses
  - Mitigation: enforce computed addresses from config; print them at boot.
- Shield bus driver direction control (DE/RE)
  - Mitigation: tie DE high/RE low per shield docs; confirm continuous TX.

